 "remarks": "Designer's custom home! Only five years young and curated from the ground up, this modern farmhouse features stunning site lines, dramatic lighting, tons of natural light and superior quality from award winning builders. A can't be beat blend of luxury, modern amenities and truly open concept living space. Wide-plank hardwood floors, artisan millwork, and built-ins integrate with golden fixtures, bold wallpapers, and modern paint palette. A 2-story entry spills into the open kitchen, dining and family room. Highlights are the contrasting, custom inset kitchen cabinetry, center Quartzite topped island, designer draperies in the dining room, papered focal and fireplaced wall in the family room. The entire space is swathed in windows with sliders to the patio. The primary bedroom suite is complete with gas fireplace, dual walk in closets, and glamourous full bath. Sliding barn doors open to the laundry. A junior suite includes a full bath ensuite and WIC. Not to be missed: the finished third floor with both a studio and a separate private office designed with vaulting ceiling, and built-ins. All customized by the owners. The finished lower level is perfect for fitness, movies, entertaining. The community, The Preserve, recipient of a HOBI award, includes 17 single family, detached homes with the maintenance-free aspect offered by the HOA (snow plowing, landscaping, irrigation). Sited within easy reach of commuting routes, only a few miles to Calf Pasture Beach.",
